@startuml deployment
title Deployment – docker compose (docker-compose.yml)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

node "Developer workstation" {
  node "VS Code" {
    artifact "ai-bug-tracker-0.2.0.vsix" as Vsix
  }
  node "Docker (Colima VM / Docker Desktop)" {
    node "backend\nimage bugtracker-backend:local\nuvicorn app.main:app\nWEB_CONCURRENCY workers" as Backend {
      component "FastAPI API" as Api
      component "Triage models (CPU)" as Models
    }
    node "db\npostgres:16.16-alpine" as Db
    node "ntfy\nbinwiederhier/ntfy:v2.38.1\ndeny-all, publish-only token" as Ntfy
    node "mailpit\naxllent/mailpit:v1.34.0" as Mail
    node "backend-bench (profile: bench)\n<db>_bench database" as Bench
    database "pgdata" as VolDb
    storage "attachments" as VolFiles
    storage "ntfy-cache, ntfy-auth" as VolNtfy
    folder "./ml/artifacts (read-only bind mount)" as VolArtifacts
  }
}

node "Phone / desktop ntfy app" as Phone

Vsix --> Api : HTTP 127.0.0.1:8000\n(TLS via reverse proxy in production, NFR-05)
Api --> Db : 5432
Api --> Ntfy : publish (Bearer token)
Api --> Mail : SMTP 1025
Bench --> Db
Db --> VolDb
Backend --> VolFiles
Ntfy --> VolNtfy
Models ..> VolArtifacts
Phone --> Ntfy : subscribe to own random topic\n127.0.0.1:8080

note bottom of Backend
  Healthcheck GET /health, restart: unless-stopped (NFR-09).
  Runs `alembic upgrade head` before starting.
  All ports bound to 127.0.0.1.
end note
@enduml
